ves and other signs and arrange appropriate testing or referral.", "slug": "leprosy-screening"}, {"category": "Venereology & Sensitive Skin", "title": "Leprosy Follow-up", "summary": "Follow-up support for patients already diagnosed with leprosy.", "detail": "Long-term follow-up may be needed to monitor treatment response, nerve function and reactions.", "approach": "Care is individualized and may involve coordination with appropriate public-health or specialist services.", "slug": "leprosy-follow-up"}, {"category": "Venereology & Sensitive Skin", "title": "White Patches Assessment", "summary": "Evaluation of pale or white-looking patches on the skin.", "detail": "White patches can be caused by vitiligo, fungal infection, post-inflammatory change or other conditions.", "approach": "Diagnosis is needed because visually similar patches can have very different causes.", "slug": "white-patches-assessment"}, {"category": "Venereology & Sensitive Skin", "title": "Penile Skin Conditions", "summary": "Assessment of persistent or recurrent skin changes affecting the penis.", "detail": "Symptoms may be due to dermatitis, fungal infection, lichen conditions, infections or other causes.", "approach": "A confidential examination helps separate these conditions and guide care.", "slug": "penile-skin-conditions"}, {"category": "Venereology & Sensitive Skin", "title": "Vulval Skin Conditions", "summary": "Assessment of itch, irritation, scaling or pigment changes affecting vulval skin.", "detail": "Vulval skin is sensitive and can be affected by dermatitis, infections and inflammatory conditions.", "approach": "The treatment approach depends on the specific diagnosis and symptoms.", "slug": "vulval-skin-conditions"}, {"category": "Venereology & Sensitive Skin", "title": "Perianal Skin Conditions", "summary": "Assessment of itching, rash or irritation around the anal area.", "detail": "Perianal symptoms can have dermatological, infectious, bowel-related or irritant causes.", "approach": "A careful history and examination help determine the source and appropriate treatment.", "slug": "perianal-skin-conditions"}, {"category": "Venereology & Sensitive Skin", "title": "Recurrent Groin Rash", "summary": "Repeated episodes of rash or itching in the groin.", "detail": "Recurrence can result from incomplete treatment, reinfection, friction, sweating or an incorrect initial diagnosis.", "approach": "A fresh assessment can help identify the factor causing the pattern.", "slug": "recurrent-groin-rash"}, {"category": "Venereology & Sensitive Skin", "title": "Confidential Skin & STI Consultation", "summary": "Private consultation for sensitive skin or sexually related dermatological concerns.", "detail": "Patients can discuss intimate skin symptoms, rashes, sores or possible exposures in a confidential clinical setting.", "approach": "The clinician can explain possible causes and the appropriate next step after assessment.", "slug": "confidential-skin-sti-consultation"}];
const grid=document.getElementById('grid'),search=document.getElementById('search'),filters=document.getElementById('filters'),count=document.getElementById('count'),empty=document.getElementById('empty'),listing=document.getElementById('listing'),detail=document.getElementById('detail');
const categories=['All',...new Set(DATA.map(x=>x.category))];let active='All';
function renderFilters(){filters.innerHTML=categories.map((c,i)=>'<button class="filter '+(c===active?'active':'')+'" data-cat="'+i+'">'+c+'</button>').join('');filters.querySelectorAll('.filter').forEach((b,i)=>b.onclick=()=>{active=categories[i];renderFilters();renderCards()})}
function renderCards(){const q=search.value.toLowerCase().trim();const list=DATA.filter(x=>(active==='All'||x.category===active)&&(!q||(x.title+' '+x.summary+' '+x.category).toLowerCase().includes(q)));count.textContent=list.length+' topics';empty.style.display=list.length?'none':'block';grid.innerHTML=list.map(x=>'<a class="card" href="treatments.html?item='+x.slug+'"><div class="cat">'+x.category+'</div><h2>'+x.title+'</h2><p>'+x.summary+'</p><div class="more">Read detail →</div></a>').join('')}
function showDetail(item){listing.classList.add('hide');detail.style.display='block';document.getElementById('dCat').textContent=item.category;document.getElementById('dTitle').textContent=item.title;document.getElementById('dSummary').textContent=item.summary;document.getElementById('dDetail').textContent=item.detail;document.getElementById('dApproach').textContent=item.approach;document.title=item.title+' | Dr. Niyaz Ahmed | Skin Care Clinic';window.scrollTo(0,0)}
const params=new URLSearchParams(location.search),slug=params.get('item');if(slug){const item=DATA.find(x=>x.slug===slug);if(item)showDetail(item);else{renderFilters();renderCards()}}else{renderFilters();renderCards()}
search.addEventListener('input',renderCards);
</script>
